  "instance_name": "mapping_001",
  "label": "Women are mapped onto the chicken",
  "description": "The top text 'I like my women like i like my chickens' explicitly maps the concept of 'women' onto the visual entity 'chicken'. The chicken is used as a metaphor for women, implying they are to be controlled and ultimately killed, as reinforced by the bottom text 'held in captivity until i behead them'. This is a direct analogical mapping where the textual entity 'women' is projected onto the visual entity 'chicken'.",
